mo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T20:38:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030255","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:59:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147270-1846651706691038","game_id":"steam-5147270","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v1.5 — Coins in motion","summary":"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46288778/2595d29453b6f0a5e911c0a6f7ff2e82f6ec319b.jpg Your coin drawer Copper, silver and gold collect in a drawer. Drag to stir; click to collect. Coins in motion Coin bursts have varied bounce timing, smoother reflections and clearer impact sounds. Smoother betting Bet directly on the slot. After the receipt prints, return to the slot. Cancelling sends the coins back. A clearer view Pixel materials, actual Bold fonts, panel placement and live language","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:18:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691038","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147270-1846651706679328","game_id":"steam-5147270","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v1.4 — A clearer betting slip","summary":"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46288778/e4599d6d334e58b28e86bb64a7163458c8d01df7.jpg A clearer betting slip Choose cells and units on one slip. Change or cancel a bet before spinning. Fixed upgrade prices Unit appearance and formation upgrades now have a fixed base price of 3 Crowns. Enhanced tiles appear at 3%, 2% or 1%, depending on the unit. Bigger wins, clearer results Win effects scale with the odds, with new coin effects and a larger hit display. A clean restart Fixed game-over","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T21:20:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679328","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147270-1846018067945394","game_id":"steam-5147270","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v1.3 — Play at your pace","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46288778/27d49f8d238feb8c3501be7eb5f0eb1ef6c16c75.jpg A lighter CATadel Smaller installation files, a new Low-spec Mode, and optimizations for market loading, coins, catapults and enemy destruction. Play at your pace Click to speed up combat, settlement and catapult animations to ×2 and ×4. Moving arrows and a short tick mark each speed increase. Clearer reports and kitchen controls Larger scout details and clearer cursed tiles. Kitchen buttons no longer overlap; added an exit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T21:42:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067945394","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147270-1846018067942637","game_id":"steam-5147270","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v1.2 — Meet Stephi","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46288778/090994f880e9e9fd5bc583c36abdf3f735db125a.jpg Meet Stephi Stephi, the black cat puppet, joins the tutorial and cheers you on throughout your run. Roulette improvements Updated the roulette backdrop, coin piles, sounds, and win or lose reactions. Bosses and telegrams Boss skill cards show effects and activations. A breached gate now leads through a telegram and execution. Relic unlocks and guidance Unlock cards appear over run results. Confirm all cards before returning","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T01:46:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942637","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147270-1846018067941268","game_id":"steam-5147270","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v1.1 - Boss Bug: Fix in Progress","summary":"A boss-related bug was found after the CATadel demo v1.1 update. I am working on a fix now. I am sorry for the trouble, and thank you for your patience and bug reports. I will post another update when the fix is live.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T15:08:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941268","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147270-1846018067940929","game_id":"steam-5147270","kind":"update","title":"Demo v1.1 — Bosses & Relics Update","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46288778/c3146c9162201a3df8fef66bbdc3456909b2ef9f.jpg To apply the new balance and progression rules, previous Continue Run saves are reset once in this update. Completed or skipped tutorial records, settings, relic unlocks and Steam achievements are kept. New runs can be saved and continued normally. Bosses fight back! Boss abilities: every Day 3 boss now has its own rule (Bone Armor, Plague Curse, Iron Wall and more). Hover the icon next to the boss name to read it. If your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T13:26:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940929","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147270-1846018067938416","game_id":"steam-5147270","kind":"update","title":"Demo hotfix — Relics stay visible in shops","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46288778/35cc46cedae940534c079a6a70963369e48b4c98.jpg Fixed the owned relic bar disappearing in shops and while cooking. Relic icons and the existing collection and selling menus are now accessible in these screens. Existing saves and progress are preserved. Balance and demo content limits are unchanged. தமிழ் கடைகளிலும் சமையல் திரையிலும் உங்களிடம் உள்ள நினைவுப் பொருட்களின் பட்டை மறைந்த பிழை சரிசெய்யப்பட்டது. அவற்றின் சின்னங்களையும் ஏற்கனவே உள்ள தொகுப்பு மற்றும் விற்பனை மெனுக்","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T12:41:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938416","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147270-1846018067938091","game_id":"steam-5147270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix — Clearer Purchases and Relic Selling","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46288778/8d921198f7f5e168262a952ce3e18af37f45846d.jpg We refined shop purchases and relic management. Clicking a relic or supply offer again opens a purchase confirmation. Confirmation and description windows no longer overlap.Owned relics can be sold through their description's Sell button after confirmation. The relic rail now offers Codex and Sell actions; owned relic entries in the Codex show full descriptions and a sale confirmation.Market ingredient purchases now play a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T09:48:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938091","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147270-1846018067937781","game_id":"steam-5147270","kind":"update","title":"Demo hotfix — clearer menus and run statistics","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46288778/4dc14443e0c99383ed0d118f0b5616d1ad3c7eaa.jpg Settings now have General, Display and Audio tabs, clearer volume sliders and visible percentages. Open Statistics from the pause menu to see this run's damage, rewards, betting results, top formations and unit cards. Books, shop windows and item descriptions have clearer layouts and typography. Fixed a close-up camera state that could linger after a telegram or restart. In the demo only, the fish stall now visibly stays cl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T04:40:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937781","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147270-1846018067936145","game_id":"steam-5147270","kind":"update","title":"Demo hotfix — tougher enemies, faster cards","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46288778/ee2e42ce20c0aa13d042013e9f621271f220b4ff.png New runs now have higher enemy HP and taxes from week 2 onward to keep up with late-game score growth. Week 1 is unchanged. Attack, decree and growth multipliers are unchanged. Unit and formation cards accelerate gently after the first 20 cards, then settle faster as the stack grows. We also fixed an overflow in high-score damage presentation. Existing saves keep their previous HP, tax rules and run length; progress and inv","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T12:17:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936145","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147270-1846018067935907","game_id":"steam-5147270","kind":"update","title":"Demo hotfix — 3 weeks and cooking limits","summary":"New demo runs cover 3 weeks. Combo and multiplier stacking currently inflate damage and scores; we shortened the demo while continuing balance work. Existing 5-week saves can continue to their original ending, and saved progress, ingredients and prepared dishes are preserved. New cooking is limited to bratwurst bread and butter-fried apples; shops sell only their ingredients and the two beers. Other recipes remain visible with a lock, the fish stall is closed until full release, and water cannot","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T10:29:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935907","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147270-1846018067935685","game_id":"steam-5147270","kind":"update","title":"Demo hotfix — controls and UI","summary":"This demo hotfix improves controls and readability. Betting position changes are disabled during the tutorial to prevent input getting stuck.Decrees now require a second click to confirm; right-click or Esc cancels the selection.Clearer finishing and remaining-spin messages, with gentle feedback for spins without a match.Fixed the formation-upgrade shop outline to follow the building.Added a Korean hover explanation for cascade combos.Added the existing button sound to menu actions and adjusted ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T08:18:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935685","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5147270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:46:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:46:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5147270":"2026-10-26T08:46:55Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5147270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:46:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:46:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:46:55Z"},"5273060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:46:55Z","las